# --- vendored agent skill packs ---
# Installed with `npx skills add ...` (see CLAUDE.md), not our source. Keeping them
# out avoids republishing flare-foundation's content inside this repo.
.agents/
.claude/skills/

# --- design references ---
# Large media (e.g. an 87MB screen-recording reference). GitHub warns above 50MB and
# blocks above 100MB; keep design refs local or in a shared drive, not in git.
ui-ux-design/

# --- skills tooling ---
skills-lock.json

# --- TEE runtime ---
# Working copy of fce-extension-scaffold with our extension swapped in. Holds
# keys and indexer credentials; regenerate rather than commit.
tee-runtime/
